  "formatted": "// AST Studio demo program\nint calculate(int a, int b) {\n    int result = a + b * 2; // precedence demo\n    if (result > 10) {\n        result = result - 1;\n    } else {\n        result = 0;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int i = 0;\n    while (i < 3) {\n        i = i + 1;\n    }\n    return calculate(i, 4);\n}\n",
